   }
  },
  {
   "object_id": "obs_conv_user_00157f98462d7a1d7ff1a34a",
   "revision": 1,
   "object_type": "observation",
   "occurred_at": "2026-11-02T17:20:00Z",
   "text": "测试环境这些实现细节你自己定，别每一步都等我确认。做完给我看结果；如果碰到会改生产数据的边界，再一次性把需要我决定的东西列出来。",
   "metadata": {
    "dimension": "dim:user_ai_interaction",
    "role": "user",
    "session_id": "resident-a-final-rerun-20260923-001",
    "turn_index": 2,
    "turn_key": "9f10a667ec0de9552f092ef4"
